      "description": "Giftful: Your Wishlist for Everything\n\nSave everything you want, discover your next favorite find, and share wishlists with the people who matter most.\n\nGiftful is the universal wishlist and shopping companion that lets you save products from any store, organize ideas for every part of your life, compare prices, discover inspiration, and share lists with friends and family. Whether you’re planning your next purchase, creating a holiday wishlist, or building a wedding or baby registry, Giftful keeps everything in one place.\n\nWhy You’ll Love Giftful\n\nONE WISHLIST FOR EVERY STORE\nSave products from any online retailer. No more keeping track of dozens of wishlists across different websites.\n\nDISCOVER PRODUCTS YOU’LL LOVE\nBrowse trending products, curated collections, creator picks, and personalized recommendations. Looking for something specific? Describe what you’re looking for and discover new ideas in seconds.\n\nSHOP SMARTER\nCompare prices across retailers and track price changes to help you find the best deal before you buy.\n\nORGANIZE EVERYTHING YOU WANT\nCreate unlimited wishlists for fashion, home, tech, travel, hobbies, your kids, holidays, or anything else you’re planning to buy.\n\nSHARE WHEN YOU WANT\nShare wishlists with friends and family for birthdays, Christmas, weddings, baby showers, graduations, housewarmings, and other special occasions.\n\nKEEP SURPRISES A SURPRISE\nFriends and family can privately claim gifts without the recipient knowing, preventing duplicate purchases while preserving the surprise.\n\nFeatures\n\n• Universal wishlist that works with virtually any online store\n• Add products in seconds from your favorite websites and apps\n• Discover products and inspiration with Find Ideas\n• Browse trending products, brands, collections, and gift ideas\n• Compare prices and track deals across retailers\n• Create unlimited wishlists for every part of your life\n• Share wishlists with friends and family\n• Private gift claiming for birthdays, holidays, and special occasions\n• Seamless sync across all your devices\n• Beautiful, fast, and easy to use\n\nWhether you're shopping for yourself, planning for the future, or sharing ideas with others, Giftful helps you organize everything you want in one place.\n\nDownload Giftful today and join millions of people discovering a better way to shop, save, and share.",
